===Noun===
{{en-noun|-}}

# {{context|pathology|lang=en}} An abnormal [[accumulation]] of [[air]] in [[tissue]]s, most commonly the [[lung]]s.
# {{context|medicine|lang=en}} [[pulmonary emphysema|Pulmonary emphysema]], a chronic lung disease.

